    {
      "id": 200,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        -600,
        0
      ],
      "size": [
        540,
        760
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 0,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "What to download / where to put it",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# 360 panorama from one photo - Krea 2 (2 passes)\n\n## Models (in `ComfyUI/models/`)\n| File | Folder |\n|---|---|\n| [krea2_turbo_fp8_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Krea-2/blob/main/diffusion_models/krea2_turbo_fp8_scaled.safetensors) | `diffusion_models/` |\n| [qwen3vl_4b_fp8_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Krea-2/blob/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_4b_fp8_scaled.safetensors) | `text_encoders/` |\n| [qwen_image_vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Krea-2/blob/main/vae/qwen_image_vae.safetensors) | `vae/` |\n| [krea2_oedit_360_erp_outpaint_lora_v1.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/mickmumpitz/Krea2-360-ERP-LoRAs/blob/main/krea2_oedit_360_erp_outpaint_lora_v1.safetensors) | `loras/` |\n\nAny subfolder of `loras/` works: just select the file in the LoRA node.\n\n## Custom nodes (in `ComfyUI/custom_nodes/`)\n- **ComfyUI-PerspToERP** (photo projection + 180 degree roll): https://github.com/shisa84/ComfyUI-PerspToERP\n- **ComfyUI-Krea2-Ostris-Edit**: https://github.com/ostris/ComfyUI-Krea2-Ostris-Edit\n- **ComfyUI-KJNodes** (soft paste of the photo): https://github.com/kijai/ComfyUI-KJNodes\n\nRestart ComfyUI after installing.\n\n## Settings to adapt\n- **Input photo**: load your photo.\n- **Field of view** (`h_fov_deg`): 90 = normal interior photo, 110 = wide angle, 65 = portrait photo.\n- **Texts**: the fields whose title starts with \"EDIT ME\".\n- **Scene** is used by pass 1; **Style only** (no furniture words) and **Back** (what is behind the camera) are used by pass 2.\n- 10 steps per pass; 6 steps is faster with a similar result.\n"
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
  ],
